  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Border Management in the Silk Routes Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is to support the countries of the Silk Routes region in building more effective and efficient border management systems, using as a blueprint the European Integrated Border Management concept and its developments, reflecting its principles and main components as laid down in the EBCG Regulation and translating them to the specific situations and realities of partner Silk Routes countries.</narrative>
  </description>
